ather than merely fitting the evaluated configural patterns; 'right for the right reason' is asserted but not operationalized beyond matching the rule, which is exactly the compliance-tracking the problem asks to distinguish. Thus the stated evidence does not distinguish a genuine reliability gain from checklist compliance that tracks the right answer.","target":"8c7b05e6ae9a5ab1d85ac312bc7b6f895c3b09e6911932543169925727dc6a20"}]}